    {
      "ja": "シリーズのキーコンセプト「シンプル組み立て」「カスタム遊び」のもと、ガトリングガンを含めた武器群がオプションパーツセットで登場！",
      "en": "Based on the series' key concepts of \"simple assembly \" and \" custom play,\" weapons including the Gatling gun are now available as optional parts sets!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 武器の内容は「DF-GA-08 HU-BEN」「DF-ET-09 TAI-YANG-SHOU」「BML-G2/P17SPL-16」「BML-G1/P20MLT-04」。",
      "en": "• Weapons include \"DF-GA-08 HU-BEN \", \" DF-ET-09 TAI-YANG-SHOU \", \" BML-G2/P17SPL-16 \", and \" BML-G1/P20MLT-04\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 装備する際に左右で形状が変わる武装は再現用のパーツがそれぞれ付属し、選択式で組み立てが可能。",
      "en": "• Weapons that change shape on the left and right when equipped come with parts for reproduction, and can be assembled selectively."
    }
